\n主な特徴\n•身長163cm\n•見た目年齢１６歳\n•オッドアイ、右目(黄色い目)の瞳孔は星の形\n•ケモミミの耳先、しっぽ先と髪の毛先には白のグラデーションがあります\n\n▼使用用途\nSNSのアイコンやベッタ－、パソコンの背景などに使わせていただきます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1AxcCEankxZty1OK4gnxFuTxxGFOYD9pv", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@FfE5_00/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1c6d7b4/uploads/origins/9a0223b5-b8e5-41af-96b9-6853a9399fe3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0f297d82c13eca50f9143ebfbd5b5e0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e1c6d7b4/uploads/origins/9a0223b5-b8e5-41af-96b9-6853a9399fe3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d0f297d82c13eca50f9143ebfbd5b5e0, https://si.imgix.net/e1c6d7b4/uploads/origins/9a0223b5-b8e5-41af-96b9-6853a9399fe3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3378aa67bfdb195b5b0a87af38d9275d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e1c6d7b4/uploads/origins/9a0223b5-b8e5-41af-96b9-6853a9399fe3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82b3061db56cf38879ab145705f31207 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your Multiple illustration. Can you draw one for my character?like this【https://skeb.jp/@FfE5_00/works/2】\n\n翠（The blond,boy,180cm）：いつも笑顔、面白いことと蓮を揶揄うのが好き\n漣（Black hair ,boy,175cm）：冷静沈着、でもいつも翠が彼の予想を遥か越えて、彼をどうしようもなくさせる\n\nThey are both high school students.Please paint freely according to their settings!\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PVu3MCNLjpVcVLBNZX9YgaJFfZTAwRG4?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@FfE5_00/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3275882c/uploads/origins/0c2bd8ae-4f82-4143-a781-cd390deb9655?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9cb7b3c2f92dfa311ef5bbe6c9d09a62", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3275882c/uploads/origins/0c2bd8ae-4f82